---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Bhangra Shop
permalink: /shop/
description: Official Leicester Bhangra Classes merchandise.
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Bhangra shop</span>
    <h1 class="h-page">Rep the LBC family</h1>
    <p class="lead">Our online shop is coming soon. In the meantime, ask your teacher about merchandise at your next class.</p>
    <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn--yellow" href="/join/?tier=gold">Become a Gold member</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container section__inner">
    <div class="section__head"><span class="eyebrow">Official merchandise</span><h2>Coming soon</h2></div>
    <div class="grid grid--narrow">
      {% for i in [1, 2, 3, 4] %}
      <div class="card"><div class="ph ph--light ph--card">Photo: LBC merch item</div><b>[PRODUCT NAME]</b><span class="muted">£[PRICE]</span></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="alert alert--info">Gold members get free personalised merchandise once a year and access to exclusive merchandise.</p>
  </div>
</section>
